{"abstract":"In recent years, we have witnessed a rise in voices advocating more human-centered and holistic approaches to research on robot technology. Towards this end, the adoption of broader perspectives and the exploration of critical questions related to the design and study of these technologies in everyday life have become increasingly pressing. In this workshop, we aim for researchers and industry experts to experience hands-on approaches to explore how we can address critical human-centered perspectives in robot research and whether critical questions within the area of Human-Robot Interaction (HRI) can be considered a new emerging paradigm: critical robotics. We invite people from a variety of disciplines both inside and outside of HRI and HCI (e.g., education, media and communication, philosophy of technology, applied ethics) to submit a short position paper and join us in an open exploration of this burning topic already identified by leading researchers in HRI and HCI.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Ljungblad, Sara","Milosevic, Tijana","Bhroin, Niamh Ni","Nørgård, Rikke Toft","Lindgren, Pamela","Ess, Charles Melvin","Barendregt, Wolmet","Obaid, Mohammad"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-159452"],"event":{"acronym":"NordiCHI","title":"Nordic Conference on Human-Computer Interaction"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway","Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Chalmers University of Technology","University of Gothenburg","University of Oslo","Uppsala University"],"keyword":["Design","Ethics","HRI"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"critical robotics exploring a new paradigm","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85056588002","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-159452","identifier":[{"id":"85056588002","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-34abe027-6cac-4a14-a2da-0eb8b36d7635"],"keyword":["Critical robotics","Design","Ethics","HRI"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-7B77F17C86A3199F5A131C45B4B8679E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"university of oslo","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Oslo","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Centre for Teaching Development and Digital Media"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"se","key":"chalmers university of technology","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Chalmers University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"se","key":"university of gothenburg","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"University of Gothenburg","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"se","key":"uppsala university","loc":["Sweden","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Uppsala University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sara","key":"ljungbladpau","last":"Ljungblad","name":"Ljungblad, Sara","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Tijana","key":"milosevicpau","last":"Milosevic","name":"Milosevic, Tijana","rank":2,"rolecode":"pa